                <pb facs="0049" n="43" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg43"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby, chargé, to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 34.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-01"><hi rendition="#italic">August 1, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received August 2.)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>War is declared. Japanese chargé d’affaires left Peking to-day. Has placed
                    interests [of] Japanese subjects in charge of legation of the United States.
                    Outbreak feared [at] Tientsin. Request war vessel.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
